SynthLab Atlas Use Policy
Version 2.1

1. Scope of this License

This License governs the Model and its Derivatives only. "Model" means the
SynthLab Atlas 7B model weights, configuration files and inference code
distributed by SynthLab. "Derivatives" means fine-tunes, checkpoints, distilled
versions, merged weights and any other model artifacts derived from the Model.

2. Training Data

The Data used to train the Model is not licensed under this License. The Data is
subject to its own separate terms and is not redistributed with the Model. No
rights in the Data are granted or implied by this License.

3. Outputs

We claim no rights in the Output you generate with the Model. You are solely
responsible for the Output and for its use, including any redistribution of
Output in a dataset. This License does not grant any license to the Output.

4. Use-based restrictions

You may not use the Model or its Derivatives to:
  (a) generate or distribute content that violates applicable law;
  (b) provide medical, legal or financial advice without human oversight;
  (c) impersonate any person or organization;
  (d) conduct surveillance or profiling of individuals.

Any distribution of the Model or its Derivatives, and any derivative work based
on the Model, must impose these same use-based restrictions on downstream
recipients. These restrictions survive redistribution.

5. Commercial use

Commercial use of the Model and its Derivatives is permitted, subject to the
restrictions in Section 4.

6. No dataset license

This License does not license the Data, does not license the Output, and grants
no rights to redistribute any dataset that incorporates the Model or its Output.
